          "_name": "article01",
          "_sourceTheme": "glancem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article01 glancem5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Image Shadow\" value=\"#2C2625\" name=\"shadow\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#97c9af\" name=\"container\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Border\" name=\"showMainBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"mainBorder\" condition=\"showMainBorder\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/glancem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#2C2625\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/glancem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                        <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                                Textiles</h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Riders Trading &amp; Manufacturing S.C. entered the textile sector with the strategic acquisition of ELSE Textile Industry in 2022. This facility is a fully integrated textile factory located in Adama, Ethiopia.<br></p>\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Current Operations</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap, .list-wrapper\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                <li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.03rem;\"><b>Ginning:</b> The facility has a modern ginning mill with a daily production capacity of 20 tons of lint cotton.</span></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.03rem;\"><b>Spinning: </b>It is equipped with both ring frame and open-end spinning systems, producing over 20 tons of yarn daily.</span></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.03rem;\"><b>Weaving</b>: The factory offers woven and knitted gray fabric, with a daily output of more than 35,000 meters. The facility also features in-house recycling units for sustainability.</span></li>\n                            </ul>\n                              <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Expansion Projects</h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Riders plans to expand our textile operations to create a fully integrated apparel value chain. This includes:<br></p>\n                            <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap, .list-wrapper\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                <li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.03rem;\"><b>Wet Processing:</b> A new line will be established for bleaching, dyeing, and printing.</span></li><li class=\"item-wrap\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: -0.03rem;\"><b>Garment Manufacturing:</b> A facility is being planned for end-to-end apparel production, including design, cutting, stitching, and finishing.</span></li>\n                            </ul>\n                            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"mailto:info@ridersgroupsc.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Request More Info</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1d3a3190-869x579.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
